# Generated by drive_arena.py on every local (non---live) run: a throwaway
# document root holding the page under test plus a copy of the feed. Regenerated
# each time, so it is never worth committing — and an untracked directory sitting
# here is exactly what another session's `git add -A` sweeps into an unrelated
# commit. Ignored locally rather than in the repo-root .gitignore, which is
# shared state several sessions edit.
_harness/
